text:
@DailyLoud Not real lol. You won’t find that huge clam in a shallow river, and there’s no way she’d be able to open the clam that easily if it were alive.

Moreover, the clam was clearly dead when she opened it. Even the tissues looked old.

Fake. Just as the “pearls” are fake.

